:: story.painting1.commit [unfinished]
{=

(metadata:
    "title", "Attempting to Paint",
    "devNote", [Haven't figured out game economy yet, done choices are not finished (no destination). Consider making it chancy.],
)

($funcMainContent:
[{<!--?mainReading-->

($funcReveal: "You set oil onto the canvas.", "set")` `|set)[(either:
    [The old oil resists you. Turpentine stings your nose.],
    [Viscous and pliable, full of promises.],
    [So begins race against time.],
    [The paint awaits your command, but not for long.],
    [It is a most delicate moment. ],
)]

|set)[
<br>
($funcReveal: "Now, try your best.", "best")]` `|best)[(either:
    [Swish, swash, and a little dot...],
    [Dribble, dabble, and a line to break the monotony...],
    [Left, right, and reapply...],
    [Oh no... That's not right... How about...?],
    [Stroke by stroke, any quiver of the wrist risks undoing your progress.],
)]

|best)[
<br>
($funcReveal: "A little more...", "little")]` `|little)[(either: 
    [It is all coming together. But to form what?],
    [Slowly, familiar shapes emerge, though you cannot say what they are.],
    [Now and gone again, you glimpse the person that you were.],
    [The brush, the oil, the canvas - they and you are not strangers after all.],
    [There is warmth between your fingers. You are so close.],
)]

|little)[
<br>
($funcReveal: "And?", "and")]` `|and)[For a moment, you thought you had made a breakthrough. But no. (either:
    [You are only making it worse. Happy accidents are happier if left well enough alone - a lesson you always seem to forget.],
    [Hope seemed so close when viewed at angle, but as you rush headlong towards it, you found out that it was only a trick of the light.],
    [What were you //thinking//? Of course, nothing. You blacked out. You blame those unsteady hands and deny that they have ever been yours.],
    [Those with talent knows when to stop. You, however, have wildly overshot.],
)]

|and)[
<br>
(if: ($funcOutputFlag: "restless") < 1)[Clearly, "your best" is not enough today, predictably so.]
(else:)[No, this cannot be "your best". There is still some left in you - fumes, furious fumes.]
<br>
(if: ($funcOutputFlag: "restless") < 1)+$cssDesc[You ought to have given up much sooner.]
(else:)+$cssDesc[Are you going to just give up, like always?]

(show: ?mainDone)
]

}],

[{<!--?mainDone-->

<ol>
<li>($funcGainLink: "Disappointed. Frustrated. You throw the brush aside and go lie down.", "restless", 1, [(display: "code.timePass")], "")</li>

<li>($funcCheckGate: "Power through! It is just over the horizon; you need only reach.", true, "restless", 1, false, 100, [], "", "")</li>

</ol>

}],


false
)